From 684f44aa5a8c54f9af107192030d4a002c200f13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:36:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 98/98] fix(executorch): list arm64 Linux CPUs in the support
 row

The executorch support row named x86_64 only, from when et-server had no
other build. et-server v0.3.1 ships an aarch64 musl build too, and on an
arm64 host the model store drops every model whose recipe the host does
not support, so executorch models, image classifiers included, were hidden
there. The row now names x86_64 and arm64, as tflite's does.

BackendModeContractTest checks that executorch, onnxruntime and tflite
each list both CPU families for Linux. The support tables in README.md and
docs/dev/backends-reference.md are regenerated.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
---
 README.md                                     |  2 +-
 docs/dev/backends-reference.md                |  2 +-
 .../lemon/backends/executorch/executorch.h    |  8 ++++----
 test/cpp/test_backend_mode_contract.cpp       | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 25 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index bb5995209..20d5bd8af 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -384,7 +384,7 @@ Lemonade supports multiple inference engines for LLM, speech, TTS, and image gen
     <tr>
       <td rowspan="1"><code>executorch</code></td>
       <td><code>system</code>†</td>
-      <td><code>x86_64</code> CPU</td>
+      <td><code>x86_64</code>/ARM64 CPU</td>
       <td>Linux</td>
     </tr>
   </tbody>
diff --git a/docs/dev/backends-reference.md b/docs/dev/backends-reference.md
index fa47808cd..b5abedff0 100644
--- a/docs/dev/backends-reference.md
+++ b/docs/dev/backends-reference.md
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ Each backend has a tier and a format; see [Backend Tiers and Formats](../api/lem
 | `acestep` | vulkan | experimental | native | linux, windows | amd_gpu; cpu (x86_64); nvidia_gpu |
 | `acestep` | rocm | experimental | native | linux, windows | amd_gpu (gfx103X, gfx110X, gfx1150, gfx1151, gfx1152, gfx120X) |
 | `ds4` | rocm | guest | native | linux | amd_gpu (gfx1151) |
-| `executorch` | system | experimental | native | linux | cpu (x86_64) |
+| `executorch` | system | experimental | native | linux | cpu (arm64, x86_64) |
 | `flm` | npu | core | native | linux, windows | amd_npu (XDNA2) |
